etItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4355220,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-4355220","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T08:40:57Z","value":23,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5120170","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4355220-1846651706691214","game_id":"steam-4355220","kind":"announcement","title":"New Tool in the Heritage Flipper Demo: The Replanker!","summary":"Steam Next Fest is here, and the Heritage Flipper demo just got biggerMeet the Replanker, our newest tool. Pull up old, worn floor planks and broken fence boards, then lay down fresh wood and watch the place come back to life. It joins the tools you already know: the pressure washer, sandblaster, paint, grass trimmer, and more. Even more ways to restore old homes, inside and out.Prefer to play from the couch? The demo fully supports controllers, so grab your gamepad and get renovating. Already p","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:48:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691214","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4355220-1846018067930044","game_id":"steam-4355220","kind":"announcement","title":"Heritage Flipper Demo Is Out Now","summary":"🏡 The doors are openThe Heritage Flipper demo is live and free to play right now. 🧡Your story starts at your grandparents' home. From there you take on your first job in the Netherlands. 🌷 After that, the rest is yours to discover. 🧰 What's in the demo💦 Power washing✨ Sandblasting🎨 Wall painting🌿 Grass trimming🛋️ Decoration🗑️ Trash collection💬 Help us shape the game This is an early look, and your feedback matters. Share your thoughts in the Steam discussions or join our Discord: https://discord","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T15:00:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067930044","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4355220-1845383656393522","game_id":"steam-4355220","kind":"announcement","title":"Heritage Flipper Demo Arrives a Day Early: October 8","summary":"Good news: the Heritage Flipper demo is coming one day early.New release time: October 8, 8 AM PDT (15:00 UTC). Previously: October 9. In the demo, your first job is an old house in the Netherlands. Clean it, restore it, and bring it back to life. Buy it, and new jobs open up, including one in another country. Can you guess which one? Drop your guess in the comments. We'll see who gets it right on October 8. The demo will also be part of Steam Next Fest, October 19 to 26. Wishlist Heritage Flipp","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T13:59:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656393522","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4355220-1844751498225304","game_id":"steam-4355220","kind":"announcement","title":"The Heritage Flipper Demo Is Coming. October 9","summary":"Somewhere out there, an old house is waiting.Its windows are dusty. Its walls have faded. Nobody has opened the door in years.But the house remembers everything.On October 9, you get the keys.The demo takes you to two countries. Two different styles. Two different kinds of homes, each with its own story.Which countries? We're not telling.You'll find out when you step inside.Scrub away the years. Bring the colors back. Listen closely while you work. 🔑 Want to step inside before anyone else?We're ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T17:00:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498225304","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4355220-1842212951303842","game_id":"steam-4355220","kind":"announcement","title":"Heritage Flipper is Coming to Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Heritage Flipper is Heading to Steam Next Fest!We are thrilled to announce that Heritage Flipper will be participating in the upcoming Steam Next Fest from October 19 to October 26!Whether you love bringing forgotten structures back to life or simply enjoy cozy, hands-on restoration, this is your chance to jump in and experience the game firsthand. What to Expect in the Demo:Hands-on Restoration: Experience the core mechanics of cleaning, repairing, and redecorating unique historic properties.Co","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-28T17:00:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951303842","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4355220-1836506165570932","game_id":"steam-4355220","kind":"announcement","title":"Heritage Flipper Playtest V1 - Apply Now","summary":"We're opening Playtest V1 for Heritage Flipper and we need your eyes on it.This is a limited, controlled playtest - not a public beta. We'll hand-pick testers from applications and send selected players a Steam key directly.What we ask:Play through the build within the given timeframeTake notes as you goFill out a feedback form when you're doneApply here: https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeHvhyYR2FRIYcTNdsqFd4oGSEct8bnsmLLKJ6vbFIznEmJgA/viewform?usp=dialogSelected testers will be contact","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-03T16:00:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165570932","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4355220-1832700592792759","game_id":"steam-4355220","kind":"announcement","title":"Should You Be Able to Paint Over 500-Year-Old Stone?","summary":"You've just spent an hour sandblasting centuries of grime off an ancient stone wall. The texture underneath is raw, warm, and full of history. And now you're standing there with a roller full of clean white paint. Do we let you do it?Heritage Flipper is built on contrast, sleek modern furniture against exposed historic brickwork. That tension is the aesthetic. But paint is the one tool that can erase it entirely. So we're asking you directly:Should players be free to paint over original stonewor","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-15T17:21:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592792759","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4355220-1826992588598078","game_id":"steam-4355220","kind":"announcement","title":"🏛️ Join the Official Heritage Flipper Discord!","summary":"🏛️ The Doors Are OpenWe've officially opened the doors to the official Heritage Flipper Discord server, and we'd love for you to be part of it from the beginning. Why Join Now?Heritage Flipper is still in development, and this is where the game gets shaped. As an early community member, you'll get:Behind-the-scenes updates Dev logs, progress screenshots, and design decisions before they go anywhere else.Your voice in development Polls, feedback threads, and direct access to the team.First to kno","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-